TVFreedom launcher

Parts of the Material 3 Expressive look (Palette, Motion, CookieDrawable and the clock, title and focus behaviour)
are ported from Material TV Launcher, https://github.com/0xRampey/material-tv-launcher (commit eccdc92),
Copyright its authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-material-tv-launcher).

app/src/thirdParty/java holds Google's material-color-utilities, Apache License 2.0
(see app/src/thirdParty/java/LICENSE and README.md).

app/src/main/assets/fonts/GoogleSansFlex.ttf is Google Sans Flex, SIL Open Font License 1.1
(see GoogleSansFlex-OFL.txt and GoogleSansFlex-TRADEMARKS.md next to it).

app/src/main/res/drawable/lw_*.xml are app icons from Lawnicons, https://github.com/LawnchairLauncher/lawnicons
(commit 8e25153), Copyright its authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-lawnicons).
They were converted from SVG to Android vector drawables; the shapes are unchanged.
